claude-pace/

# Local product context (not part of the public repository)
/PRODUCT.md

# Local-only blog migration helper. Kept off the source tree on purpose —
# the skill at pilot/skills/sync-blog/ runs it from /Users locally.
scripts/sync-blog.py
scripts/blog-dates.json

